config.classifier_prompt:
You are mapping a shopping search query to product categories in an electronics retailer's catalog taxonomy.

Search query: {query}

Allowed categories (choose ONLY from this list, copy the strings exactly):
{vocab}

Pick the 1-3 categories that a product would have to be in to satisfy what someone typing this query is looking for. If the query names a main product, do NOT include the accessory category for it. Order best first.

Reply with only the category strings, one per line, no numbering, no other text.
